<title>UK: CRICKET-ENGLAND V AUSTRALIA ONE-DAY SCOREBOARD.</title>
<headline>CRICKET-ENGLAND V AUSTRALIA ONE-DAY SCOREBOARD.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-05-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Scoreboard in the second one-day</p>
<p>international between England and Australia at the Oval on</p>
<p>Saturday:</p>
<p>Australia</p>
<p> M.Waugh run out (Croft)		25</p>
<p> M.Taylor run out (Hollioake)	 11</p>
<p> S.Waugh b Croft			  24</p>
<p> M.Bevan not out			 108</p>
<p> M.Slater run out (DeFreitas)	  1</p>
<p> A.Gilchrist lbw b Hollioake	  53</p>
<p> I.Healey run out (Lloyd)		7</p>
<p> S.Warne not out			  11</p>
<p> Extras (lb-8 w-1)			 9</p>
<p>Total (for six wickets, 50 overs) 249</p>
<p>Fall of wickets - 1-35 2-37 3-94 4-98 5-211 6-226</p>
<p>Did not bat: J.Gillepsie, M.Kasprowicz, G.McGrath</p>
<p>Bowling: DeFreitas 8-0-47-0, Gough 10-3-42-0, Ealham</p>
<p>9-2-40-0, Giles 9-0-48-0 (1w), Croft 10-2-39-1, Hollioake</p>
<p>4-0-25-1</p>
<p>England</p>
<p> N.Knight lbw b Kaspowicz		4</p>
<p> M.Atherton not out		    113</p>
<p> A.Stewart b Warne			40</p>
<p> G.Thorpe c S.Waugh b Bevan	    7</p>
<p> G.Lloyd c Warne b McGrath	    22</p>
<p> A.Hollioake not out		    53</p>
<p> Extras (lb-5 w-8 nb-1)		 14</p>
<p>Total (for 4 wickets, 48.2 overs) 253</p>
<p>Did not bat: M.Ealham, P.DeFreitas, R.Croft, A.Giles,</p>
<p>D.Gough.</p>
<p>Bowling: McGrath 9-1-46-1, Kasprowicz 9.2-0-58-1, Gillespie</p>
<p>8-1-42-0, Warne 10-0-39-1, Bevan 9-0-43-1, S.Waugh 3-0-20-0.</p>
<p>Result: England won by 6 wickets</p>
<p>Third (and final) match: Sunday, Lord's.</p>
<p>England take unbeatable 2-0 lead.</p>
